The audit independently joined all 1,022 original proposal objects in 11 exact published proposal cores to the 10 published decision cores containing all 1,879 case outcomes. The original cdff plan selects 1,018 proposal origins in 934 operation objects; the four unselected original dispositions remain unchanged. Complete source objects and hashes are retained in the inventories. The one W03 GYPS dependent proposal has a genuine W05 causal case; the final join preserves that ownership rather than assuming every proposal case belongs to its author shard.

Ten selected operations retain concrete named application conditions that the inspected later evidence does not discharge. Root has selected bounded deferral: four overlapping HCl creates, Swine Serum promotion, BBL BD211065 create, Difco Nutrient Broth create, Wilkins-Chalgren promotion, Ward's Cerophyll create, and generic Cerophyll promotion. Actual kinds are seven creates and three promotions; thirteen distinct original case tuples remain intact. Original proposal fields and source decisions are not rewritten. The exact joins, every case digest, promotion preimage, counterpart, and issue reference appear in TEN-OPERATION-DISPOSITION-JOINS.json.

The full prospective 3,550-owner catalog was assembled only in memory from the authentic committed A baseline and every exact cdff payload capture. No incoming component/ingredient reference uses any of the ten identifiers. The scan records all exact scalar matches separately; it is not a name-similarity or scientific equivalence inference. All 2,956 baseline owner hashes were preserved on reread. Deferring these operations therefore does not leave one of those identifier links orphaned in the inspected inventory. This does not authorize arbitrary removal of other owners or source cases.

HCl: all four original descriptions explicitly require a common bounded partial-material decision or comparable preparation/product evidence before co-installation. Current W01 complete-row recommendations retain the overlap/installation hold, and the earlier central inventory is a planning disposition without application approval. The nominal ten-stock composition resolves other named scopes, not these four HCl owners. Unknown percentage basis, carrier, or strength is not itself a scientific defect and does not prove equality or difference. Deferral avoids choosing a winner.

Swine: current source evidence supports the MD960/1076b heat-inactivated context. Its exact original proposal nevertheless retains APPLICATION/EXPORT HOLD before promotion pending broader raw-label routing review. Current row0775 retains the global-routing hold. Deferral preserves UNMAPPED_0536 and all original cases; no claim that Porcine_Serum is untreated or different is made.

W03: the BD211065, Difco nutrient, and CM0643 originals expressly prohibit application until their named owner-continuity corrections are reconciled. Their old counterparts are not changed by cdff. Nutrient_Broth_No_2 still contains BD234000/Difco resolving catalog tokens; the old heart-only record still carries the BD211065 preferred-name context and unrelated Difco/Eiken aliases. The separate typo-spelled Wilkins owner retains its own source2140 provenance. CM0643 is a promotion, not a create; both authentic unmapped records remain if deferred. These are source-level conditions, not a requirement to solve all product lots. W05's separately supported dry CM0643 remains distinct from this unresolved continuity obligation; no automatic product merge follows.

Cerophyll: W01's Ward product proposal explicitly requires reconciliation with generic MD2360 before integration. Current W09 full-row support retains that continuity/routing condition, while W01 supports the separate generic dry input. No inspected later two-owner reconciliation satisfies the condition. Deferring the pair preserves the existing UNMAPPED_0357 owner and both source-case routes; it does not conclude the two materials are equal or distinct.

Known issues remain separately accounted: #758 coupled phosphate fragments, the three stock creates already covered by d403/#1237, and original TSB/ten-vitamin/retired EBIOS dispositions. The corrected failed-B phosphate status receipt is pinned; this audit does not reinterpret or resume that failed root.

Affirmative current reconciliation is distinguished from new blockers. The HEPES pair, four nominal95%ethanol origins, two Wolfe pairs, and three Hutner origins coalesce into their exact selected nominal operations, rather than being installed as competing historical candidate owners. The Columbia two-origin product composition and authentic generic0118 dependency are present together. The ferric-ammonium-EDTA child is selected with its dependent stock. These are mechanical joins to separately reviewed decisions; this author does not renew scientific approval of compositions authored earlier by this agent.

Other limitations are not automatically source-application prohibitions. The two PPLO catalog owners retain generic ownership and native admission/hold obligations but do not contain the same specific apply-only-after condition as the three W03 dispositions above; no new source deferral is inferred here. The Middlebrook base versus enriched-medium distinction and dated ATCC MD-TMS versus historical formulation scope have affirmative bounded row evidence. CMRL keeps incompatible catalog labels non-resolving. SL12/PCRS/Gaffron version and quantitative source-association restrictions are retained; this audit does not apply current tables to incompatible frozen occurrences. Ordinary chemistry, assay, role, source-membership, export and unsupported-alias holds remain in their existing workflows. They are not promoted to demands for new research or automatically used to discard safe provenance edits.

This is a bounded original-object/application-precondition audit, not a new 1,022-owner scientific vote. The full field extraction covers all proposals; targeted condition discovery is followed by the explicit manual dispositions above. NO_ADDITIONAL_CONCRETE_APPLICATION_BLOCK_IDENTIFIED is a scope-limited result, not blanket approval. No source, selected plan, acceptance, native gate, process, Git, GitHub or worker state was mutated. No native prepare was called on any root.

Preserved local attempt: complete_joins.py initially assumed a proposal's causal case belonged to its author worker and stopped on the genuine W03→W05 GYPS case before writing any joined report. complete_joins_v2.py preserves actual global case ownership, verifies uniqueness and exact native case hashes, and passed. The original code/error output remains. This was a private audit assumption correction, not a source/native defect or changed scientific lineage.
